                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.31507/2609.31507v1/overview-final.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Overview of SatNav. The benchmark spans diverse cities and scenes, and introduces three task families:Boundary(partial-arc,extended-loop,full-loop),Landmark(one-turn,two-turn), andRoute(road,waterway,hybrid). During navigation, the agent receives an instruction and a satellite crop generated by rotate-and-crop operations, then predicts and executes actions in the satellite map.",
